      "title": {
        "en": "Andrzejki"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "*Andrzejki* is the night of 29 November, St Andrew's Eve, when friends *wróżą* (tell fortunes). The best-known *wróżba*: you melt *wosk* (wax) from a *świeca* (a candle) in a *garnek* (a pot), pour it through a *klucz* (a key) into cold water, and read your future from its *cień* (its shadow) on the wall."
      }
    }
  ],
